The *.gz files here are a selection of plaso's test_data files of the same names (PCA,
IIS, Windows Firewall, PowerShell transcript, TeamViewer, SetupAPI and SCCM
logs: test_data/, test_data/iis/, test_data/teamviewer/), under the Apache
License 2.0 (LICENSE, in this directory). Copyright the plaso authors.

Source: https://github.com/log2timeline/plaso at commit
91b6849503b125267d00ea134248e4fe59e5479c. Stored gzip-compressed (gzip -9n),
otherwise unmodified.

ad_svc.trace.gz and connection_trace.txt.gz were written for the
sootmark-winlogs tests (https://github.com/Sootmark/winlogs) in AnyDesk's
formats, with example addresses and made-up IDs; under this crate's
licences.
